		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Burnished golden scales with inner light. 60-foot-long drake, translucent wings. Haughty and superior.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 61, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +9 (2d10) or 1 sun breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Starflight</strong>. Dragon and riders can survive the interstellar void. Able to fly between worlds in 1d4 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sun Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) of burning sunlight, extending double near from dragon. CON 15+ or 4d10 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunblood</strong>. Fire immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
